# Backend settings live in Supabase Edge Function secrets, not in Vite env files.
# Configure these per Supabase project:
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY
# FROM_EMAIL
# SITE_URL
# RESEND_API_KEY
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY